 "html": "<!--\n\tSurvey Response Detail \u2014 portrait A4.\n\n\tEverything `doc.answer_rows`/`doc.recipient_name`/`doc.survey_title`\n\treads here is attached by `Survey Response.before_print`, not stored on\n\tthe doctype itself. `doc.answer_rows[].is_correct` is `None` unless the\n\tsurvey's scoring mode is one of `SCORING_TYPES_REVEALING_ANSWERS` \u2014 the\n\tsame \"Scoring Without Answers\" gate the player and the certificate\n\trespect, so correctness never leaks here either.\n-->\n<style>\n.print-format {\n\torientation: Portrait;\n\tpage-size: A4;\n}\n\n.response-detail { font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif; color: #1f2933; }\n\n.response-detail__header { margin-bottom: 6mm; border-bottom: 0.4mm solid #d1d5db; padding-bottom: 4mm; }\n.response-detail__title { font-size: 16pt; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 2mm; }\n.response-detail__meta { font-size: 9.5pt; color: #6b7280; margin: 0; }\n.response-detail__meta span + span::before { content: \" \\00b7 \"; }\n\n.response-detail__section { font-size: 11pt; font-weight: 700; margin: 5mm 0 2mm; color: #6d28d9; }\n\ntable.response-detail__answers { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 9.5pt; }\ntable.response-detail__answers th, table.response-detail__answers td {\n\tborder: 0.2mm solid #e5e7eb;\n\tpadding: 1.5mm 2.5mm;\n\ttext-align: left;\n\tvertical-align: top;\n}\ntable.response-detail__answers th { background: #f9fafb; font-weight: 600; }\n\n.answer--skipped { color: #9ca3af; font-style: italic; }\n.answer--correct { color: #15803d; }\n.answer--incorrect { color: #b42318; }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"response-detail\">\n\t<div class=\"response-detail__header\">\n\t\t<h1 class=\"response-detail__title\">{{ doc.survey_title | e }}</h1>\n\t\t<p class=\"response-detail__meta\">\n\t\t\t<span>{{ doc.recipient_name | e }}</span>\n\t\t\t{% if doc.completed_on %}<span>{{ frappe.format_date(doc.completed_on) }}</span>{% endif %}\n\t\t\t{% if doc.score_percentage is not none and doc.total_score %}\n\t\t\t<span>{{ _(\"Score\") }}: {{ \"%.1f\"|format(doc.score_percentage) }}%</span>\n\t\t\t{% endif %}\n\t\t</p>\n\t</div>\n\n\t{% set ns = namespace(section=\"\") %}\n\t<table class=\"response-detail__answers\">\n\t\t<thead>\n\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t<th style=\"width: 55%\">{{ _(\"Question\") }}</th>\n\t\t\t\t<th style=\"width: 45%\">{{ _(\"Answer\") }}</th>\n\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t</thead>\n\t\t<tbody>\n\t\t\t{% for row in doc.answer_rows %}\n\t\t\t{% if row.section_title != ns.section %}\n\t\t\t{% set ns.section = row.section_title %}\n\t\t\t<tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"response-detail__section\">{{ row.section_title | e }}</td></tr>\n\t\t\t{% endif %}\n\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t<td>{{ row.question_title | e }}</td>\n\t\t\t\t<td class=\"{% if row.skipped %}answer--skipped{% elif row.is_correct == true %}answer--correct{% elif row.is_correct == false %}answer--incorrect{% endif %}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t{% if row.skipped %}{{ _(\"Skipped\") }}{% else %}{{ row.answer | e }}{% endif %}\n\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t{% endfor %}\n\t\t</tbody>\n\t</table>\n</div>\n",
